# Free-free: no /BCS. OpenRadioss explicit inertial-relief analogue = /ADYREL (engine)
#   + /DAMP Rayleigh mass (starter). Radioss has no PARAM,INREL (that is OptiStruct).
#   Closed /PLOAD is self-equilibrated (net F≈0); /ADYREL+/DAMP kill residual RB drift.
